<title>JAPAN: Bellsystem plans to repurchase up to 42,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Bellsystem plans to repurchase up to 42,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bellsystem 24 Inc, a telemarketing firm, said on Thursday that it plans to repurchase up to 42,000 of its common shares in order to implement a stock option plan.</p>
<p>The buy-back would not exceed 910 million yen, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Bellsystem added that the repurchase plan will be carried out after it is approved at the annual shareholders' meeting scheduled for August 27.</p>
</text>
